WEBVTT

01:40.210 --> 01:42.920
[Spring of The Blade]

01:43.789 --> 01:45.950
[Episode 2]

01:46.509 --> 01:47.970
The ceremony is complete.

01:48.640 --> 01:50.440
Congratulations, Fourth Lady,

01:50.759 --> 01:52.160
on returning to the clan.

02:02.230 --> 02:04.160
I know that, given my lowly status,

02:04.480 --> 02:06.150
I am not worthy of making my father

02:06.150 --> 02:08.520
set aside his official duties
and return home.

02:08.520 --> 02:09.800
But I really wish

02:09.800 --> 02:12.200
I could serve him a cup of tea
as his daughter

02:12.360 --> 02:14.220
to show my affection and concern.

02:17.470 --> 02:19.520
There's nothing wrong
with your filial piety.

02:19.520 --> 02:22.000
But with honored guests here,

02:22.310 --> 02:23.840
it's inappropriate for you

02:24.030 --> 02:25.280
to kneel all the time.

02:25.840 --> 02:26.590
Indeed.

02:27.190 --> 02:29.190
As beautiful as she is,

02:29.710 --> 02:31.120
it would be a pity to ruin her knees.

02:31.120 --> 02:31.910
Who is this?

02:31.910 --> 02:33.150
- It must be Lord Yan from the capital.
-Lord Yan.

02:33.150 --> 02:34.560
-Greetings, Your Lordship.
-Greetings, Your Lordship.

02:34.560 --> 02:36.130
-Lord Yan.
-Lord Yan.

02:36.240 --> 02:38.770
This must be the Fourth Lady
of the Xie family.

02:41.000 --> 02:44.030
I heard you were missing for years,

02:45.030 --> 02:47.190
but a fire brought news of you.

02:47.630 --> 02:49.430
You truly are blessed by God.

02:50.030 --> 02:51.710
You really took advantage of the fire

02:51.710 --> 02:52.970
to return home safely.

02:53.750 --> 02:54.680
Qingyuan,

02:54.910 --> 02:56.240
we have a distinguished guest.

02:56.240 --> 02:57.560
Stand up and greet him.

03:11.750 --> 03:12.750
Be careful, lady.

03:18.280 --> 03:19.630
I am Xie Qingyuan.

03:20.150 --> 03:21.350
Greetings, Lord Yan.

03:24.280 --> 03:25.400
You know my name?

03:26.360 --> 03:27.000
What?

03:27.750 --> 03:29.000
Have we met before?

03:30.630 --> 03:32.690
I saw you have an imposing appearance

03:33.000 --> 03:34.560
which far outshone
that of ordinary people,

03:34.560 --> 03:35.760
so I ventured a guess.

03:36.280 --> 03:37.190
If I am wrong,

03:38.120 --> 03:40.050
please forgive me, Your Lordship.

03:41.150 --> 03:42.150
You are not wrong.

03:43.150 --> 03:45.010
You have a sharp eye, Fourth Lady.

03:45.710 --> 03:47.150
Could you read my face

03:47.750 --> 03:48.960
and tell

03:49.750 --> 03:51.950
how many days I can survive in Hengtang?

04:02.150 --> 04:03.080
Qingyuan,

04:03.590 --> 04:04.960
put away your little tricks

04:04.960 --> 04:06.120
and speak properly.

04:06.430 --> 04:08.960
Can't you see what occasion it is today?

04:11.470 --> 04:13.520
Since you are one of the Xie family now,

04:13.520 --> 04:16.269
you must learn our rules.

04:26.800 --> 04:28.600
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

04:27.830 --> 04:29.750
The Xie Residence is quite lively today.

04:29.750 --> 04:31.630
I heard they brought
their Fourth Lady back

04:31.630 --> 04:32.870
just in order to ward off evil.

04:32.870 --> 04:34.240
The patriarch of the Xie family,

04:34.240 --> 04:35.430
Lord Xie Shu,

04:35.680 --> 04:37.430
is stationed at the Northern Frontier
all year round

04:37.430 --> 04:38.830
and rarely returns home.

04:39.310 --> 04:40.480
It's such a big event

04:40.480 --> 04:42.080
as his own daughter's return

04:42.120 --> 04:43.360
to the clan,

04:44.510 --> 04:46.110
yet he didn't even come back.

04:47.070 --> 04:48.560
It's normal he didn't.

04:49.240 --> 04:51.040
You madams probably don't know.

04:51.120 --> 04:53.720
About this Fourth Lady,
who returned today,

04:54.070 --> 04:55.310
her birth mother

04:55.920 --> 04:57.270
once killed someone.

04:59.070 --> 05:00.000
Killed someone?

05:00.190 --> 05:02.360
Everyone knows the Third Lady, Qingrong,

05:02.360 --> 05:04.870
is listed under the name
of the Head Madam, Madam Hu.

05:04.870 --> 05:06.930
But her birth mother, Concubine Xia,

05:06.950 --> 05:08.270
was killed

05:08.270 --> 05:10.190
by the birth mother of this Fourth Lady,

05:10.190 --> 05:11.250
who just returned.

05:11.510 --> 05:12.720
This incident caused

05:12.720 --> 05:14.120
quite a stir back then.

05:14.600 --> 05:15.510
From now on,

05:15.630 --> 05:17.830
there will be no peaceful days for sure.

05:18.000 --> 05:19.240
If I were Lord Xie,

05:19.430 --> 05:21.870
I would also prefer to stay
at the frontier for some peace and quiet.

05:21.870 --> 05:22.720
Nonsense.

05:22.720 --> 05:23.800
Alright, alright.

05:24.480 --> 05:25.280
We are guests.

05:26.000 --> 05:27.190
Stop gossiping about the hosts.

05:27.190 --> 05:29.160
Madam Hu has arrived!

05:41.040 --> 05:43.170
[Mei Yinghua, Lord Xie's Second Concubine]

05:41.159 --> 05:41.960
Second Madam,

05:42.040 --> 05:43.440
the ceremony is over now.

05:43.760 --> 05:46.270
[Liuhua Courtyard]

05:43.920 --> 05:44.780
The Old Madam is

05:44.830 --> 05:46.360
receiving guests in the front hall.

05:46.360 --> 05:48.560
Are you really not going to take a look?

05:49.190 --> 05:50.520
What is there to look at?

05:51.040 --> 05:52.480
The harmonious grandmother
and granddaughter

05:52.480 --> 05:53.950
are enjoying family happiness.

05:53.950 --> 05:56.360
They've never
cared about my thoughts anyway.

05:56.360 --> 05:58.270
Wouldn't I just be
making myself miserable by going?

05:58.270 --> 05:58.870
I won't go.

06:00.720 --> 06:02.510
Our Eldest Lady

06:03.120 --> 06:05.190
has the same personality as her mother.

06:05.190 --> 06:07.310
She likes peace and quiet
and doesn't talk much.

06:07.310 --> 06:10.800
No one knows where she's hiding right now.

06:13.360 --> 06:14.040
Mother.

06:16.950 --> 06:18.550
This is my daughter, Qingru,

06:18.800 --> 06:19.800
the second child.

06:20.240 --> 06:21.480
Greetings, madams.

06:22.830 --> 06:24.950
These are March Red lychees
just sent from Danzhou

06:24.950 --> 06:26.210
for you to have a taste.

06:29.430 --> 06:31.000
What a wonderful girl.

06:31.830 --> 06:33.230
You raised her very well.

06:34.920 --> 06:36.510
Qingru, you may leave.

06:37.430 --> 06:38.040
Yes.

06:41.510 --> 06:43.440
Madam Hu, you've nurtured her well

06:43.600 --> 06:44.680
into a proper heiress.

06:44.680 --> 06:45.510
Indeed.

06:47.830 --> 06:50.230
When I visited
the Xie Residence last time,

06:50.480 --> 06:52.810
the place was a mess,
burned down by a fire.

06:53.680 --> 06:56.310
Now it has been restored
so fast and elegantly.

06:56.310 --> 06:57.630
Seems like the repairs went well.

06:57.630 --> 06:59.120
Yes, of course!

06:59.560 --> 07:01.950
It cost over ten thousand taels of silver

07:01.950 --> 07:03.750
to restore it to its original state.

07:03.750 --> 07:05.750
Even the crabapple tree in the courtyard

07:05.750 --> 07:08.560
was replaced
with an identical one from outside.

07:10.720 --> 07:11.630
This wine is

07:11.720 --> 07:12.920
refreshing and delicious.

07:12.920 --> 07:13.680
Good wine.

07:13.800 --> 07:15.360
Speaking of this wine,

07:15.750 --> 07:18.270
it's certainly not a treasure.

07:18.800 --> 07:20.680
Despite the ordinary wine,

07:21.000 --> 07:24.000
the cups I chose for it are not bad.

07:24.120 --> 07:26.190
It's genuine Yaozhou celadon,

07:26.510 --> 07:29.000
the first batch from the old kiln.

07:30.000 --> 07:32.150
Second Young Master,
you're quite generous.

07:32.150 --> 07:35.310
Having this Yaozhou celadon
at the ancestry reclaiming banquet

07:35.310 --> 07:37.480
just shows how wealthy the Xie family is.

07:37.480 --> 07:38.950
Yes, of course!

07:39.270 --> 07:41.240
Our Xie family is famous in Hengtang.

07:41.240 --> 07:43.370
There are hundreds, if not thousands,

07:43.430 --> 07:45.090
of rare treasures in our home!

07:45.310 --> 07:46.190
Zhengjun!

07:47.630 --> 07:48.430
Grandmother.

07:48.430 --> 07:49.360
Zhengjun,

07:49.510 --> 07:50.480
you're drunk.

07:51.800 --> 07:52.560
Lord Yan,

07:52.950 --> 07:54.610
don't listen to his nonsense.

07:55.190 --> 07:55.990
Second Madam,

07:56.040 --> 07:57.630
Second Young Master caused trouble again

07:57.630 --> 07:59.090
and annoyed the Old Madam.

07:59.630 --> 08:00.600
Is Zhengjun

08:00.600 --> 08:01.750
an idiot?

08:02.040 --> 08:03.480
The wealthy families in Hengtang are all

08:03.480 --> 08:05.040
keeping a low profile
to survive the winter.

08:05.040 --> 08:07.600
He's the only one
showing off our wealth outside,

08:07.600 --> 08:10.130
like he wants others
to target our Xie family.

08:11.070 --> 08:13.870
Anyway, since this pool of water is
already muddy,

08:14.000 --> 08:15.750
let's stir it up even worse.

08:18.680 --> 08:20.160
Qingrong is not

08:20.310 --> 08:22.240
a generous girl, is she?

08:23.870 --> 08:25.400
Go point her in a direction.

08:26.040 --> 08:26.870
How can

08:27.430 --> 08:29.190
our Zhengjun bear the blame

08:29.600 --> 08:30.560
alone?

08:31.390 --> 08:32.110
Yes.

08:46.510 --> 08:47.310
Third Sister.

08:48.550 --> 08:50.790
Don't call me sister.

08:51.630 --> 08:53.440
As the daughter of a murderer,

08:53.910 --> 08:55.480
born bad,

08:56.360 --> 08:58.790
do you deserve
to step into the Xie Residence?

08:58.790 --> 08:59.670
Third Sister,

09:00.240 --> 09:01.550
whether you want it or not,

09:01.550 --> 09:02.750
whether you're willing or not,

09:02.750 --> 09:04.360
as long as I'm still surnamed Xie,

09:04.360 --> 09:06.480
we have to live under the same roof.

09:06.840 --> 09:08.320
I don't want to make an enemy of you.

09:08.320 --> 09:10.270
Please be magnanimous, Third Sister.

09:10.270 --> 09:11.600
Grandmother is still waiting for me.

09:11.600 --> 09:12.660
I'll take my leave.

09:12.870 --> 09:16.800
Do you think I'm afraid of you
just because you brought up the Old Madam?

09:17.600 --> 09:18.750
Be magnanimous?

09:19.480 --> 09:21.000
When your mother used euphorbia

09:21.000 --> 09:22.150
to kill my mother,

09:22.390 --> 09:23.120
did she ever anticipate

09:23.120 --> 09:26.250
that one day her daughter
would have to pay with her life?

09:28.240 --> 09:30.320
Today is your return
and ancestor worship ceremony.

09:30.320 --> 09:31.150
Guess

09:32.000 --> 09:33.200
who the sacrifice is.

09:37.120 --> 09:38.580
Just before the ceremony,

09:38.670 --> 09:41.070
Grandmother gave you this longevity lock.

09:42.270 --> 09:43.510
This longevity lock

09:44.150 --> 09:47.390
was specially purified
with incense ash from the altar

09:47.870 --> 09:49.530
just in order to ward off evil.

09:50.200 --> 09:51.600
Do you know why you were left outside

09:51.600 --> 09:53.320
for so many years
without anyone looking for you,

09:53.320 --> 09:55.850
but they chose
to put you in the genealogy now?

09:56.630 --> 09:59.200
Because a concubine's daughter
born on the Ghost Festival

09:59.200 --> 10:01.240
makes the best scapegoat.

10:01.840 --> 10:03.270
You want a long life?

10:03.480 --> 10:05.740
I want you to pay
with your life right now!

10:05.840 --> 10:07.790
I want you to pay
with your life right now!

10:07.790 --> 10:08.550
Qingrong!

10:10.670 --> 10:12.730
What nonsense are you talking about?

10:15.360 --> 10:16.120
Old Madam,

10:16.840 --> 10:18.040
what brings you here?

10:18.150 --> 10:19.950
If I didn't come looking for you,

10:20.440 --> 10:21.510
how would I know someone

10:21.510 --> 10:23.480
could be this audacious?

10:24.480 --> 10:25.120
Yuejian,

10:25.600 --> 10:26.730
take the Fourth Lady

10:27.080 --> 10:28.960
to receive the distinguished guests.

10:28.960 --> 10:31.120
Then go to Wuzhu Courtyard

10:31.750 --> 10:33.440
and get the First Madam here.

10:34.440 --> 10:35.030
Yes.

10:44.870 --> 10:45.670
You,

10:46.320 --> 10:47.200
come with me.

10:55.480 --> 10:57.270
Penalty drink! Drink!

10:57.440 --> 10:57.960
Penalty drink!

10:57.960 --> 10:59.560
Lord Yan, you are so amazing.

10:59.630 --> 11:00.290
It's yours.

11:00.550 --> 11:01.680
Thank you, Lord Yan.

11:06.840 --> 11:07.750
Qingyuan!

11:10.440 --> 11:11.440
Fourth Lady,

11:11.910 --> 11:13.630
you are the star of today's event.

11:13.630 --> 11:15.670
Your second brother has drunk too much.

11:15.670 --> 11:16.400
Why don't you

11:16.480 --> 11:17.390
drink for him?

11:17.510 --> 11:18.550
Okay!

11:18.910 --> 11:20.600
Let Lord Yan check out

11:20.840 --> 11:23.200
how extraordinarily smart Qingyuan is.

11:24.840 --> 11:26.200
Pay with her life?

11:26.360 --> 11:27.550
Scapegoat?

11:28.150 --> 11:29.080
Have you ever

11:29.080 --> 11:31.270
thought about the consequences

11:31.480 --> 11:33.550
if the guests today hear what you said?

11:33.550 --> 11:34.350
Grandmother,

11:34.510 --> 11:36.200
the fact that I didn't kill her
on the spot just now

11:36.200 --> 11:38.750
was already me
protecting the Xie family's reputation.

11:38.750 --> 11:41.150
Everything started because of her mother.

11:41.550 --> 11:42.670
Just let Jin

11:42.870 --> 11:44.200
harm her own daughter!

11:44.200 --> 11:45.400
How dare you quibble?

11:46.360 --> 11:47.910
I have repeatedly ordered

11:48.240 --> 11:50.240
not to mention the past grievances.

11:50.440 --> 11:52.320
Do my words fall on deaf ears?

11:52.360 --> 11:54.760
Then did my mother
deserve to die unjustly?

11:58.080 --> 12:00.720
I heard Qingrong caused trouble.

12:01.240 --> 12:02.270
Qingrong,

12:02.270 --> 12:03.870
I'm not trying to scold you.

12:04.550 --> 12:07.200
But you've been
with the Head Madam for so long,

12:07.200 --> 12:09.790
and how can you still be so reckless?

12:10.480 --> 12:11.240
Old Madam.

12:11.670 --> 12:13.320
Concubine Mei, you're right.

12:13.320 --> 12:15.200
I failed to discipline her well.

12:15.720 --> 12:18.270
I will be stricter with her from now on.

12:21.960 --> 12:24.690
You are so passionate
about criticizing others,

12:24.790 --> 12:26.450
but you are no better, either.

12:26.750 --> 12:30.150
Yan Rui was ordered by His Majesty
to root out corruption for disaster relief.

12:30.150 --> 12:32.480
Our Xie family is in a sensitive position.

12:32.750 --> 12:34.480
And your silly son

12:35.150 --> 12:36.630
kept talking nonsense,

12:37.080 --> 12:38.680
letting others catch us out.

12:38.960 --> 12:40.290
How did you educate him?

12:41.240 --> 12:42.150
In short,

12:42.670 --> 12:44.330
from now on in this residence,

12:45.000 --> 12:47.440
everyone must watch their words and deeds.

12:47.960 --> 12:50.790
You must not make mistakes like today's.

12:52.150 --> 12:53.270
-Yes.
-Yes.

13:01.600 --> 13:03.390
The object Lord Yan hid

13:03.480 --> 13:05.080
should be round in shape

13:05.600 --> 13:06.730
and contain liquid—

13:07.440 --> 13:08.080
lamp oil.

13:11.720 --> 13:12.600
Let me open it!

13:12.720 --> 13:13.050
Look.

13:13.480 --> 13:14.920
It really is.

13:15.120 --> 13:16.650
Qingyuan, you are amazing!

13:18.270 --> 13:19.730
I will take my leave first.

13:21.270 --> 13:22.670
-Stop there.
-Qingyuan.

13:25.240 --> 13:27.960
Ladies just all
play hard to get like this.

13:29.750 --> 13:30.510
Your Lordship,

13:30.510 --> 13:32.040
please mind your behavior.

13:32.750 --> 13:33.600
Are you angry?

13:34.360 --> 13:35.840
Are you thinking of

13:35.840 --> 13:37.790
splashing that lamp oil on me

13:38.120 --> 13:39.670
and setting me on fire?

13:43.120 --> 13:44.080
I wouldn't dare.

13:45.030 --> 13:46.630
You wouldn't dare to commit arson,

13:46.630 --> 13:48.560
or you wouldn't dare to bet with me?

13:49.790 --> 13:50.650
Your Lordship,

13:50.790 --> 13:52.590
I just guessed blindly just now.

13:52.960 --> 13:55.090
I would never dare to compete with you.

13:55.150 --> 13:56.410
Your Lordship, please

13:56.510 --> 13:57.910
don't make things difficult for others.

13:57.910 --> 14:00.720
I just like to beat tough guys.

14:02.360 --> 14:03.720
What are you afraid of?

14:04.120 --> 14:04.910
Qingyuan,

14:05.030 --> 14:06.150
bet with him.

14:08.480 --> 14:10.630
Then, Fourth Lady, please

14:10.870 --> 14:13.440
guess what's in my sachet

14:13.750 --> 14:15.150
and how much it's worth.

14:15.360 --> 14:17.480
Let's see if it matches your answer.

14:20.840 --> 14:22.630
Lord Yan is back.

14:22.670 --> 14:23.800
-Lord Yan.
-Cheers.

14:24.310 --> 14:25.270
-Come on.
-Cheers.

14:25.270 --> 14:26.600
-Cheers.
-Let's drink.

14:27.080 --> 14:27.840
Cheers.

14:35.320 --> 14:36.790
The thing in the sachet is

14:37.150 --> 14:39.200
the most valuable treasure in the world.

14:39.200 --> 14:40.130
It's priceless.

14:42.200 --> 14:43.330
You are wrong, lady.

14:48.480 --> 14:50.080
This is just a pile

14:50.510 --> 14:52.030
of moldy millet.

14:54.000 --> 14:55.130
How is it priceless?

14:55.600 --> 14:57.550
Grain is the common people's foundation.

14:57.550 --> 14:59.870
His Majesty has warned the officials

15:00.150 --> 15:02.200
to value grain over gold and jade.

15:02.630 --> 15:03.960
After millet is cooked,

15:04.240 --> 15:05.550
it can not only fill the stomach,

15:05.550 --> 15:07.360
but long-term storage can also be

15:07.360 --> 15:09.120
a preparation for emergencies.

15:09.120 --> 15:10.750
Even moldy millet

15:10.960 --> 15:13.030
is still a priceless treasure

15:13.480 --> 15:14.720
for starving people.

15:16.070 --> 15:19.240
Therefore, I think this answer is correct.

15:21.080 --> 15:23.210
Fourth Lady, you're really eloquent.

15:23.630 --> 15:24.550
You can even talk up

15:24.550 --> 15:26.720
this pile of rotten grain
as an invaluable treasure.

15:26.720 --> 15:27.790
Then why don't you

15:28.030 --> 15:29.360
come with me

15:29.630 --> 15:31.490
to see how many of these treasures

15:32.080 --> 15:33.960
your Xie family's farm has?

15:35.360 --> 15:35.790
Be careful.

15:35.790 --> 15:37.910
-Why did Lord Yan bring up the farm?
-I'm okay.

15:37.910 --> 15:38.640
Is it related

15:39.080 --> 15:40.600
to the recent corruption case?

15:40.600 --> 15:41.720
Keep it down.

15:42.390 --> 15:43.440
Lord Yan,

15:43.670 --> 15:45.840
you are really well-informed.

15:46.120 --> 15:47.840
The Xie family's farm

15:48.080 --> 15:49.200
does indeed

15:49.320 --> 15:51.480
have some old grain stored.

15:51.840 --> 15:52.510
But

15:52.790 --> 15:54.240
Zhengjun traded good grain

15:54.240 --> 15:56.390
for them.

15:56.910 --> 15:58.510
As long as we can,

15:58.750 --> 16:01.960
we won't let people eat moldy grain.

16:02.960 --> 16:04.630
Qingyuan is right.

16:05.080 --> 16:06.480
Grain may be cheap,

16:06.840 --> 16:09.170
but it concerns the people's livelihood,

16:09.200 --> 16:11.130
making it more precious than gold.

16:11.200 --> 16:14.150
Given the disaster
Hengtang is suffering from right now,

16:14.150 --> 16:16.030
on behalf of the Xie family,

16:16.390 --> 16:17.870
I'd like to donate

16:18.510 --> 16:19.550
100 dan of grain.

16:21.200 --> 16:22.600
100 dan?

16:22.600 --> 16:23.440
That's a lot.

16:24.240 --> 16:26.750
It's enough to feed 200 households
for 3 months.

16:26.750 --> 16:28.550
You are so righteous, Old Madam.

16:28.720 --> 16:30.630
I'm deeply impressed.

16:32.200 --> 16:35.150
Then I thank you in advance, Old Madam.

16:38.750 --> 16:40.440
Fourth Lady, it seems that you are

16:40.440 --> 16:42.240
indeed the Xie family's mascot.

16:42.510 --> 16:43.510
I'm flattered.

16:44.080 --> 16:46.550
It's all thanks to the Xie family's
profound ancestral blessings

16:46.550 --> 16:48.600
and the Old Madam's grace.

16:56.670 --> 17:00.320
♪ Lest he prove untrue
and leave us heartbroken ♪

17:03.630 --> 17:05.310
The southern opera is performed tonight

17:04.829 --> 17:07.180
♪ Today Zhang Xie rides through
the streets in triumph ♪

17:05.920 --> 17:08.720
to welcome you into the family.

17:07.829 --> 17:09.099
♪ But he's short of helping hands ♪

17:10.160 --> 17:12.280
♪ Let's go lend him ours ♪

17:10.960 --> 17:13.000
Back then, this song was

17:14.150 --> 17:17.900
♪ The ghosts will bear the sedan chair ♪

17:14.240 --> 17:15.900
your mother's favorite, too.

17:19.619 --> 17:22.079
♪ The gods will blow the trumpets ♪

17:27.000 --> 17:29.110
Yan Rui visited us today.

17:29.440 --> 17:30.480
If the Xie family

17:30.640 --> 17:33.100
had gotten involved
in the corruption case,

17:33.110 --> 17:35.270
it would've definitely caused us
grave damage

17:35.270 --> 17:36.960
and disastrous consequences.

17:36.960 --> 17:38.110
Fortunately, you

17:38.160 --> 17:39.550
stayed composed in the face of danger

17:39.550 --> 17:41.070
and acted appropriately.

17:42.030 --> 17:43.440
You handled it very well.

17:43.880 --> 17:45.750
I just used some small tricks.

17:46.200 --> 17:49.070
I don't deserve your praise, Grandmother.

17:49.240 --> 17:50.840
I am already deeply grateful

17:50.960 --> 17:52.590
that you don't blame me

17:52.920 --> 17:54.960
for embarrassing the Xie family.

17:56.960 --> 18:00.750
When I was little, I lived a lonely,
difficult life away from the Xie Residence,

18:00.750 --> 18:02.610
growing up among the common folk.

18:03.270 --> 18:06.030
My birth mother once made a grave mistake

18:06.510 --> 18:07.770
and harmed the family.

18:08.030 --> 18:10.920
Logically speaking, my background

18:11.510 --> 18:13.270
is not worthy of the Xie family.

18:15.790 --> 18:17.270
You didn't abandon me, Grandmother,

18:17.270 --> 18:20.270
which allowed me
to enjoy today's blessings.

18:21.030 --> 18:22.430
I cannot repay you enough

18:22.440 --> 18:24.400
for this kindness.

18:24.590 --> 18:28.550
From now on, I promise I will place
the Xie family above everything else.

18:28.550 --> 18:30.000
I will give it my all

18:30.440 --> 18:32.040
until the very end of my life.

18:35.160 --> 18:36.510
Silly girl.

18:36.960 --> 18:38.830
You call me Grandmother,

18:39.400 --> 18:41.070
so we are family.

18:41.440 --> 18:42.640
Since we are family,

18:43.000 --> 18:44.830
we should let go of past grudges

18:45.200 --> 18:46.440
and help each other.

18:47.030 --> 18:48.240
As the saying goes,

18:48.310 --> 18:50.840
a child is innocent
of their parents' crimes.

18:51.000 --> 18:53.240
As long as I am in the Xie family,

18:53.640 --> 18:54.550
I will never

18:54.880 --> 18:57.210
let anyone make things difficult for you.

19:04.830 --> 19:06.230
Thank you, Grandmother.

19:07.830 --> 19:11.250
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

19:11.280 --> 19:13.420
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

19:13.440 --> 19:16.940
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

19:17.110 --> 19:18.000
Come on, Your Lordship,

19:18.000 --> 19:19.400
let me pour you a drink.

19:22.790 --> 19:23.650
Your Lordship,

19:23.680 --> 19:26.110
I left the banquet quite early today.

19:26.480 --> 19:27.640
I heard that you

19:27.830 --> 19:29.750
gained a lot from the Xie family.

19:30.110 --> 19:30.790
What?

19:31.110 --> 19:33.110
Lord Wei, you want to raise the stakes?

19:33.110 --> 19:34.550
That's perfect.

19:34.720 --> 19:37.030
I was just worrying about
not having enough.

19:37.030 --> 19:38.160
I wouldn't dare.

19:38.310 --> 19:39.550
I was a bit reckless.

19:40.110 --> 19:41.550
I thought

19:42.240 --> 19:45.790
you wanted to use the Xie family
to investigate the corruption case.

19:45.790 --> 19:47.990
I am here this time for disaster relief.

19:48.310 --> 19:49.720
If it's not handled well,

19:49.920 --> 19:51.480
it might irritate His Majesty.

19:51.480 --> 19:53.000
So, for the food collection,

19:53.000 --> 19:54.550
Lord Wei, please

19:55.000 --> 19:56.730
pay more attention to it for me.

19:57.200 --> 19:59.030
As for corruption,

19:59.510 --> 20:01.440
I will just catch several people,

20:01.640 --> 20:03.000
take them to the capital,

20:03.000 --> 20:04.200
and consider it done.

20:09.750 --> 20:12.480
My Lady, what are your plans now?

20:13.000 --> 20:15.260
Firstly, gain the trust of the Old Madam.

20:15.480 --> 20:17.590
And then investigate
my mother's unjust case.

20:17.590 --> 20:18.550
No rush.

20:18.830 --> 20:20.270
They will eventually know

20:20.270 --> 20:23.070
I am the vengeful demon,
back to claim their lives.

20:33.640 --> 20:34.840
You may go back first.

20:36.200 --> 20:36.960
Yes.

20:57.270 --> 20:58.070
Third Sister.

20:59.070 --> 21:00.550
You are quite composed.

21:01.310 --> 21:02.070
You already know

21:02.070 --> 21:03.920
why the Xie family got you back,

21:05.200 --> 21:06.720
and you're still not leaving?

21:06.720 --> 21:07.480
Leave?

21:08.070 --> 21:08.920
Where to?

21:09.640 --> 21:11.640
Since I have been listed
in the Xie family's genealogy,

21:11.640 --> 21:12.700
I am one of the Xies.

21:13.440 --> 21:15.240
Of course, I should stay
in the Xie Residence

21:15.240 --> 21:16.960
and take care of the Old Madam.

21:17.070 --> 21:20.600
Do you think you can turn the tables
by clinging to the Old Madam?

21:31.160 --> 21:33.360
Your Lordship, what are you looking at?

21:39.830 --> 21:42.440
Lord Wei, please help me check

21:43.310 --> 21:45.350
if the one standing on the bridge is

21:45.590 --> 21:47.450
the Fourth Lady of the Xie family.

21:49.270 --> 21:50.870
It is indeed the Fourth Lady.

21:51.070 --> 21:52.750
No wonder she looks familiar.

21:53.030 --> 21:54.720
She really tickles my fancy.

21:55.160 --> 21:56.880
Since I've run into such a beauty,

21:56.880 --> 22:00.010
please excuse me
for ending our chitchat here, Lord Wei.

22:00.310 --> 22:02.310
Your Lordship, I'll leave you to it.

22:03.550 --> 22:04.310
Listen,

22:05.070 --> 22:06.880
even if you've been placed
in the genealogy,

22:06.880 --> 22:08.210
it can't change the fact

22:08.240 --> 22:10.640
that your mother is a murderer.

22:11.110 --> 22:12.840
But I am a lady of the Xie family,

22:13.200 --> 22:14.460
and that is also a fact.

22:15.110 --> 22:16.400
So what else can you do?

22:18.310 --> 22:19.110
Beat me,

22:19.960 --> 22:20.640
scold me,

22:21.550 --> 22:23.350
or make things difficult for me?

22:23.680 --> 22:25.070
But this filial piety

22:25.160 --> 22:27.400
won't bring any honor

22:27.590 --> 22:28.920
to the late Fifth Madam.

22:30.750 --> 22:32.950
Third Sister, your reluctance to let go

22:33.310 --> 22:34.480
will only make

22:34.510 --> 22:35.770
the Fifth Madam suffer

22:36.310 --> 22:38.170
in the netherworld day after day,

22:38.480 --> 22:39.790
unable to reincarnate.

22:39.790 --> 22:41.550
Then go to hell right now!

22:42.200 --> 22:44.060
Die and pay for my mother's death!

22:48.200 --> 22:50.200
So it's the two ladies of the Xie family.

22:50.200 --> 22:51.930
How did you two end up fighting?

23:15.640 --> 23:17.240
Someone fell into the water!

23:17.240 --> 23:18.840
Someone fell into the water!

23:19.850 --> 23:21.450
Someone fell into the water!

23:55.400 --> 23:56.110
Tell me

23:56.440 --> 23:58.270
your purpose for entering the Xie family.

23:58.270 --> 23:59.590
If I hand over the evidence of your arson

23:59.590 --> 24:00.640
to the Xie family,

24:01.030 --> 24:01.920
do you think

24:02.480 --> 24:04.410
they will believe you, a fake lady,

24:04.510 --> 24:05.640
or me, an official?

24:17.640 --> 24:18.160
My Lord.

24:18.480 --> 24:18.940
My Lord!

24:19.590 --> 24:20.050
My Lord!

24:20.720 --> 24:21.650
Wake up, My Lord!

24:22.350 --> 24:22.920
My Lord!

24:29.350 --> 24:30.000
My Lord,

24:30.440 --> 24:31.370
are you alright?

24:32.640 --> 24:33.590
Who saved me?

24:33.920 --> 24:34.480
It's...

24:35.750 --> 24:37.680
It's the Fourth Lady who saved you.

24:48.790 --> 24:50.270
Where is the estate manager?

24:50.270 --> 24:51.530
The estate manager...

24:51.790 --> 24:52.480
is dead.

24:59.880 --> 25:00.340
Come on.

25:05.070 --> 25:06.440
-Hurry!
-Move!

25:06.440 --> 25:08.240
-Move! Make way!
-Someone died.

25:17.070 --> 25:17.530
My Lord,

25:18.310 --> 25:19.440
we've searched him.

25:19.440 --> 25:20.500
The ledger is gone.

25:20.880 --> 25:21.790
Who is this dead man?

25:21.790 --> 25:22.520
I don't know.

25:28.070 --> 25:29.600
The estate manager brought

25:29.750 --> 25:31.080
the item to me as agreed.

25:51.790 --> 25:53.520
It seemed like I was the target,

25:54.790 --> 25:55.590
but actually,

25:56.480 --> 25:59.080
someone tried to stop him
from approaching me,

25:59.480 --> 26:01.750
even resorting to murder to silence him.

26:06.240 --> 26:07.840
Someone fell into the water!

26:13.920 --> 26:14.640
The ledger.

26:21.680 --> 26:22.920
Who on earth was it?

26:24.270 --> 26:25.110
Mother.

26:25.440 --> 26:27.350
Please don't worry too much.

26:27.750 --> 26:29.480
Didn't the official
who came back with Qingrong

26:29.480 --> 26:30.350
already say

26:31.030 --> 26:33.920
that the Fourth Lady
and Lord Yan are not injured?

26:34.400 --> 26:36.680
Lord Yan is a high official
from the capital.

26:36.680 --> 26:38.350
There must be many people
keeping an eye on him.

26:38.350 --> 26:40.510
It's fortunate that they aren't hurt.

26:41.000 --> 26:43.000
But an unmarried girl

26:43.440 --> 26:45.770
fell into the water
with an unrelated man.

26:45.790 --> 26:47.110
If this gets out,

26:47.110 --> 26:49.680
people will inevitably
suspect a secret rendezvous.

26:49.680 --> 26:52.140
I'm afraid that's much worse
than an injury.

26:53.160 --> 26:56.240
Qingyuan just arrived
at the Xie Residence,

26:56.240 --> 26:58.300
and she's already caused such a stir.

26:58.310 --> 27:00.510
We must keep a close eye on her
from now on

27:00.880 --> 27:04.280
to prevent her from tarnishing
our Xie family's reputation.

27:07.720 --> 27:09.180
After such a big incident,

27:09.510 --> 27:11.110
where are you going, lady?

27:14.240 --> 27:15.100
Your Lordship,

27:15.240 --> 27:16.790
although I saved your life,

27:17.240 --> 27:19.030
you don't need to appreciate it too much.

27:19.030 --> 27:20.510
If it were anyone else,

27:20.510 --> 27:22.350
I would have saved them all the same.

27:22.350 --> 27:24.350
But, Your Lordship, you really have

27:24.590 --> 27:25.850
poor swimming skills.

27:26.070 --> 27:28.470
You should practice more
when you are free.

27:30.000 --> 27:32.270
A wet-haired beauty
fleeing under the moon,

27:32.270 --> 27:33.270
how interesting.

27:34.110 --> 27:36.310
You're far more adept
at hooking up with women

27:36.310 --> 27:37.840
than investigating cases.

27:38.880 --> 27:40.080
Is that a compliment?

27:40.310 --> 27:42.110
If so, I will accept it.

27:44.310 --> 27:45.720
Fourth Lady, did you know

27:46.480 --> 27:48.080
that the person who just died

27:48.400 --> 27:50.590
is your Xie family's estate manager?

27:56.720 --> 27:57.580
Your Lordship,

27:57.830 --> 28:00.090
I have just arrived at the Xie Residence,

28:00.200 --> 28:02.860
so I am not quite familiar
with these relations.

28:02.960 --> 28:04.490
It's fine if you don't know.

28:05.110 --> 28:06.770
Then please take a look, lady.

28:07.920 --> 28:08.960
Is this sachet

28:09.240 --> 28:10.970
something from the Xie family?

28:16.510 --> 28:18.880
It should be

28:19.400 --> 28:21.000
my Second Brother's sachet.

28:22.750 --> 28:23.590
Oh, dear.

28:25.160 --> 28:26.440
We found on the corpse the belonging

28:26.440 --> 28:28.770
of your Xie family's Second Young Master.

28:29.030 --> 28:30.440
This makes things tricky.

28:30.440 --> 28:32.150
I've got no choice but to investigate

28:32.150 --> 28:33.350
according to the law.

28:34.590 --> 28:35.450
Your Lordship,

28:36.160 --> 28:37.350
the deceased

28:37.720 --> 28:39.200
died on the shore.

28:39.550 --> 28:41.830
He didn't fall into the water
before he died.

28:41.830 --> 28:43.680
This sachet is so wet.

28:44.310 --> 28:47.830
Perhaps it fell into the water
with someone else?

28:52.270 --> 28:53.930
You are so smart, Fourth Lady.

28:54.270 --> 28:55.510
Why didn't I think

28:55.510 --> 28:57.370
of drying it before taking it out?

28:58.310 --> 28:59.170
Your Lordship,

28:59.640 --> 29:01.240
are you openly telling me

29:01.480 --> 29:02.880
that you are framing him?

29:03.270 --> 29:05.240
Aren't you afraid I'll report it
to the authorities?

29:05.240 --> 29:05.920
No.

29:06.830 --> 29:08.680
Because you taught me, Fourth Lady,

29:08.680 --> 29:09.740
that if I am guilty,

29:10.070 --> 29:11.530
you will be my accomplice.

29:12.640 --> 29:13.370
Don't worry,

29:14.480 --> 29:17.410
I will definitely confess
and bring you down with me.

29:23.960 --> 29:24.820
Your Lordship,

29:25.510 --> 29:26.720
I wonder

29:27.160 --> 29:28.550
when I offended you.

29:28.960 --> 29:30.960
During the game
at the ancestry reclaiming banquet,

29:30.960 --> 29:33.110
you deliberately made things difficult
for me with stale millet.

29:33.110 --> 29:34.030
Didn't I

29:34.350 --> 29:36.960
do you a favor in return?

29:37.400 --> 29:39.240
Isn't the Xie family's 100 dan of grain

29:39.240 --> 29:40.960
enough to please you?

29:41.590 --> 29:42.640
Or

29:42.830 --> 29:43.920
do you want more?

29:44.640 --> 29:46.200
You knew exactly why I came,

29:46.510 --> 29:48.640
yet you still played along with my act.

29:48.960 --> 29:51.030
Wasn't it just to establish your prestige
in the Xie family

29:51.030 --> 29:53.070
and prove your worth as the Fourth Lady?

29:53.070 --> 29:55.270
Can we even settle the score between us?

29:55.920 --> 29:58.550
Are there any good people
in the Xie family in your eyes?

29:58.550 --> 30:01.810
And now you're playing the role
of a devoted family member?

30:01.920 --> 30:03.030
Was that big fire

30:03.240 --> 30:06.040
really just to make the Xie family
lose some money?

30:07.000 --> 30:07.730
Fourth Lady,

30:08.640 --> 30:10.590
some lies are just lies.

30:11.110 --> 30:12.550
Don't fool yourself.

30:14.640 --> 30:16.700
Then what do you want, Your Lordship?

30:17.160 --> 30:20.160
I want you to watch a good show
of the Xie family with me.

30:20.350 --> 30:22.030
Then you have got
the wrong person, Your Lordship.

30:22.030 --> 30:23.070
I don't understand shows.

30:23.070 --> 30:24.730
Right, you understand chess.

30:26.550 --> 30:27.790
You are meticulous

30:28.310 --> 30:29.710
and advance step by step.

30:30.510 --> 30:31.510
But don't forget,

30:32.000 --> 30:33.070
if a chess player

30:33.070 --> 30:35.200
cannot even see her own moves clearly,

30:35.880 --> 30:37.880
she can only be a chess piece—a pawn.

30:38.440 --> 30:39.920
But I don't need

30:40.640 --> 30:42.510
another player on my chessboard.

30:42.510 --> 30:43.790
Is it that you don't need one,

30:43.790 --> 30:44.990
or you don't want one?

30:45.240 --> 30:48.590
We walk different paths,
so we're not meant to work together.

30:48.590 --> 30:50.240
Please don't force me, Your Lordship.

30:50.240 --> 30:51.570
I just want to force you.

30:56.830 --> 30:58.890
I don't care if you're willing or not.

30:59.960 --> 31:01.160
I will definitely

31:02.880 --> 31:04.340
take control of your game.

31:15.830 --> 31:16.960
Qingrong and Qingyuan

31:16.960 --> 31:18.720
are both listed under my name.

31:19.030 --> 31:20.490
Such an incident happened

31:20.550 --> 31:22.350
due to my failure in discipline.

31:22.510 --> 31:23.970
When Qingyuan comes back,

31:24.310 --> 31:26.550
I promise I will strictly discipline her.

31:26.550 --> 31:27.720
Right now,

31:28.160 --> 31:29.790
no matter what happened,

31:30.240 --> 31:33.270
the Fourth Lady falling into the water
with an unrelated man

31:33.270 --> 31:36.070
will surely cause a scandal
if word gets out.

31:37.310 --> 31:38.000
Zhengjun.

31:38.750 --> 31:40.810
Hurry and bring the Fourth Lady back.

31:41.110 --> 31:42.750
If she stays out overnight,

31:43.240 --> 31:44.750
things will escalate.

31:45.070 --> 31:47.670
Clouds are gathering
on the horizon right now.

31:47.720 --> 31:51.030
Our family can't afford
any more incidents.

31:51.550 --> 31:52.200
Go now.

31:52.720 --> 31:53.400
Okay, okay.

31:53.680 --> 31:54.740
I'll go. I'm going.

31:55.920 --> 31:57.550
Lord Yan has arrived!

32:10.750 --> 32:11.830
Isn't she back now?

32:14.030 --> 32:14.830
Lord Yan.

32:24.400 --> 32:25.880
Qingyuan

32:26.110 --> 32:27.840
really doesn't know her place.

32:27.960 --> 32:30.440
How could she let you, Lord Yan,
escort her back personally?

32:30.440 --> 32:32.070
It's a matter of great importance.

32:32.070 --> 32:33.600
Of course I must escort her.

32:33.960 --> 32:35.490
Escorting her is one thing.

32:35.640 --> 32:38.070
But Lord Yan, why did you barge in

32:38.070 --> 32:40.640
with a troop of soldiers at midnight?

32:41.550 --> 32:43.350
If this gets out,

32:43.440 --> 32:44.310
other people

32:44.350 --> 32:47.550
might think the Xie family
has committed a serious crime.

32:48.270 --> 32:49.000
Indeed.

32:49.310 --> 32:50.440
I don't know either.

32:50.640 --> 32:52.840
Whether your Xie family is guilty or not

32:53.160 --> 32:54.820
depends on how I investigate.

32:59.550 --> 33:01.480
Why do you say that, Your Lordship?

33:02.920 --> 33:03.750
Lord Yan,

33:04.240 --> 33:06.920
did Xie Qingyuan cause any trouble

33:06.920 --> 33:08.830
and get escorted back by you as a culprit?

33:08.830 --> 33:09.480
Qingru.

33:10.440 --> 33:12.900
The Fourth Lady
did encounter some trouble.

33:13.270 --> 33:14.480
She was almost

33:15.110 --> 33:18.310
pushed into the water
by the Third Lady of your Xie family.

33:21.400 --> 33:22.680
I am the witness.

33:24.480 --> 33:27.030
The Fourth Lady saved my life underwater.

33:27.640 --> 33:28.640
It is only right

33:29.440 --> 33:32.590
for me to seek justice for her.

33:37.750 --> 33:39.480
That's not true, Grandmother.

33:39.510 --> 33:39.960
I...

33:40.350 --> 33:42.310
I just missed my mother too much,

33:42.680 --> 33:44.310
thinking of the past grievances.

33:44.310 --> 33:45.830
I didn't mean to do it.

33:46.070 --> 33:47.800
I just lost my mind for a moment.

33:48.240 --> 33:49.110
Grandmother.

33:49.480 --> 33:50.830
You fool.

33:51.160 --> 33:52.820
How many times have I told you?

33:53.550 --> 33:55.070
Don't make a fuss

33:55.200 --> 33:56.480
over baseless rumors.

33:56.750 --> 33:57.950
But you never listen!

33:58.510 --> 33:59.270
Nanny Rong.

34:01.310 --> 34:01.920
Yes, Old Madam.

34:01.920 --> 34:03.270
Take the Third Lady away

34:03.510 --> 34:05.160
and lock her in the ancestral hall.

34:05.160 --> 34:06.680
Have her copy Buddhist scriptures

34:06.680 --> 34:08.360
to reflect on her actions as a penalty.

34:08.360 --> 34:09.590
Yes, Old Madam.

34:12.360 --> 34:13.320
Third Lady,

34:13.550 --> 34:14.679
please come with me.

34:33.440 --> 34:34.230
Lord Yan,

34:34.960 --> 34:37.290
there has been a lot of misunderstanding.

34:37.590 --> 34:39.030
There is no grudge

34:39.230 --> 34:40.400
between my Third Sister and me.

34:40.400 --> 34:42.070
We just lost control of the aim

34:42.230 --> 34:43.830
when we were playing around.

34:44.190 --> 34:45.320
I'm the one to blame.

34:45.590 --> 34:46.850
I didn't stand steady.

34:47.400 --> 34:48.600
Such a trivial matter

34:48.630 --> 34:50.000
shouldn't bother you.

35:00.480 --> 35:01.150
Lord Yan.

35:01.880 --> 35:03.230
Qingrong and Qingyuan

35:03.230 --> 35:04.480
offended you today.

35:04.760 --> 35:06.090
It was indeed improper.

35:06.400 --> 35:09.230
It's truly my failure as a mother
to discipline them.

35:09.230 --> 35:10.070
I'd like

35:10.590 --> 35:12.480
to apologize to you here, Your Lordship.

35:12.480 --> 35:13.880
Please forgive us.

35:14.150 --> 35:15.280
It doesn't matter.

35:16.070 --> 35:18.400
I have no interest in the domestic affairs

35:18.590 --> 35:19.650
of your Xie family.

35:20.840 --> 35:22.900
Let's talk about something serious.

35:24.550 --> 35:26.480
The Xie family's estate manager

35:27.000 --> 35:27.880
is dead.

35:42.360 --> 35:42.960
Lord Yan,

35:43.920 --> 35:45.320
this is a weighty matter.

35:46.630 --> 35:47.510
Please

35:47.960 --> 35:50.760
move to the reception hall
to discuss it in detail.

35:56.480 --> 35:58.140
About tonight's murder case,

35:58.190 --> 36:00.390
the Fourth Lady saw it with her own eyes.

36:00.760 --> 36:02.150
The dead estate manager

36:02.760 --> 36:05.560
was clutching
your Second Young Master's sachet.

36:06.670 --> 36:09.070
If I didn't keep Fourth Lady as a witness,

36:09.670 --> 36:10.920
wouldn't it be a baseless slander

36:10.920 --> 36:13.230
against
your Second Young Master's reputation?

36:13.230 --> 36:14.190
Fourth Lady.

36:22.670 --> 36:24.670
It was dark, and my eyesight is poor.

36:25.000 --> 36:26.360
I was also very scared.

36:26.960 --> 36:27.670
I

36:27.920 --> 36:29.550
really didn't see clearly.

36:30.110 --> 36:31.110
Perhaps

36:31.510 --> 36:32.640
there was a mistake.

36:43.400 --> 36:46.030
Our Xie family has been blessed
by His Majesty's grace

36:46.030 --> 36:48.400
and stuck to our duties for years.

36:49.440 --> 36:51.840
We would never dare
to overstep our bounds.

36:51.960 --> 36:53.920
Lord Yan, you should not

36:54.760 --> 36:55.560
accuse anyone

36:56.590 --> 36:58.590
of the grave crime of murder easily.

37:01.880 --> 37:02.800
Of course,

37:03.320 --> 37:04.630
I'm well aware of it.

37:05.450 --> 37:06.510
Without evidence,

37:06.780 --> 37:09.030
I definitely wouldn't cause trouble
for no reason.

37:09.030 --> 37:09.780
Nor would I

37:09.900 --> 37:11.900
frame an innocent person randomly.

37:12.510 --> 37:13.150
Right,

37:13.430 --> 37:14.260
Fourth Lady?

37:20.180 --> 37:21.040
Your Lordship,

37:21.780 --> 37:23.740
my Second Brother is a kind person.

37:23.990 --> 37:26.030
Old Madam is also compassionate.

37:26.380 --> 37:27.710
In the face of disaster,

37:27.740 --> 37:30.470
the Xie family still thought of
how to relieve the people.

37:30.470 --> 37:31.960
With such kind hearts,

37:32.110 --> 37:33.640
how could they kill anyone?

37:33.860 --> 37:34.870
There must be

37:35.700 --> 37:37.360
some misunderstanding here.

37:37.460 --> 37:38.850
Then how on earth

37:39.210 --> 37:41.950
did this sachet end up
in the deceased's hand?

37:47.020 --> 37:48.570
Zhengjun is

37:48.980 --> 37:50.340
too playful.

37:50.460 --> 37:51.500
Usually,

37:51.770 --> 37:53.090
visiting brothels

37:53.170 --> 37:54.570
is a common thing for him.

37:54.900 --> 37:56.160
In places of pleasure,

37:56.420 --> 37:57.610
it's just common

37:58.900 --> 38:00.420
to drop a sachet, right?

38:03.900 --> 38:06.820
Is this Yunya tea?

38:10.510 --> 38:11.780
It tastes really good.

38:12.770 --> 38:14.730
It's even better than the tribute tea

38:14.730 --> 38:16.170
in the capital.

38:24.570 --> 38:26.500
You must be joking, Your Lordship.

38:26.530 --> 38:27.540
Yunya tea

38:27.770 --> 38:29.060
is nothing rare.

38:29.420 --> 38:30.610
Tomorrow, I will

38:30.860 --> 38:33.460
have someone send 2 baskets
to your residence.

38:39.730 --> 38:41.530
You may not know this, Old Madam.

38:41.820 --> 38:42.900
I am

38:43.020 --> 38:45.250
worried about raising grain every day.

38:45.770 --> 38:47.900
Now that there is another murder case,

38:48.340 --> 38:50.270
how can I be in the mood to taste tea?

38:55.020 --> 38:56.610
The Xie family's warehouse

38:57.290 --> 38:59.150
still has a little surplus grain.

39:00.060 --> 39:02.920
If it can solve your urgent problem,
Your Lordship,

39:03.380 --> 39:05.640
it can be considered a meritorious deed.

39:10.980 --> 39:13.060
Your Lordship,
are you satisfied with the result

39:13.060 --> 39:14.320
of today's chess game?

39:14.940 --> 39:16.870
Fourth Lady, you're quick-witted

39:16.900 --> 39:18.250
and meticulous about every move.

39:18.250 --> 39:19.980
You are actually more suitable

39:20.170 --> 39:21.700
for playing chess than I am.

39:27.820 --> 39:28.680
Your Lordship,

39:28.980 --> 39:30.290
you just falsely claimed

39:30.290 --> 39:31.940
to have a sachet as evidence,

39:32.250 --> 39:34.540
forcing my grandmother
to give away the grain.

39:34.540 --> 39:36.380
I didn't want to make an enemy of you,

39:36.380 --> 39:38.340
so I played along with this lie.

39:39.130 --> 39:41.060
Since you have already gotten
what you wanted,

39:41.060 --> 39:42.920
why are you still pushing so hard?

39:45.860 --> 39:47.160
How do you know that

39:47.500 --> 39:49.210
grain is all I want?

39:56.250 --> 39:58.380
No matter what you want, Your Lordship,

39:58.380 --> 39:59.130
I

39:59.570 --> 40:01.230
only implore you to show mercy

40:01.690 --> 40:03.750
and stop getting me involved in this.

40:06.020 --> 40:07.090
You want to escape?

40:08.540 --> 40:09.090
No way.

40:10.090 --> 40:12.420
There is a good saying
in the opera troupe—

40:12.420 --> 40:16.080
once the music starts, the show
must not stop until it's finished.

40:16.340 --> 40:17.870
With such a brilliant show,

40:18.380 --> 40:20.500
how could I bear to let you

40:20.980 --> 40:22.420
leave early?

40:26.570 --> 40:27.820
I wonder if you've heard

40:27.820 --> 40:28.940
about 2 sentences

40:29.210 --> 40:31.670
in the "Kṣitigarbha Sutra," Your Lordship.

40:34.340 --> 40:35.500
"All living beings

40:35.860 --> 40:36.860
not liberated

40:37.540 --> 40:39.340
have unfixed natures and minds.

40:39.690 --> 40:41.130
Doing good or evil

40:41.250 --> 40:43.180
depends on their circumstances."

40:47.860 --> 40:49.980
Your show may be brilliant, Your Lordship,

40:49.980 --> 40:51.380
but the risk is also high.

40:51.900 --> 40:54.500
If good circumstances turn bad,

40:54.940 --> 40:56.400
and good people turn evil,

40:56.770 --> 40:59.430
wouldn't the losses
outweigh the gains for you?

40:59.460 --> 41:00.300
Therefore,

41:00.540 --> 41:02.900
Your Lordship,
you still need to choose carefully

41:02.900 --> 41:04.230
and decide cautiously.

41:04.610 --> 41:05.730
Don't let

41:05.860 --> 41:07.860
an insignificant character like me

41:08.020 --> 41:10.680
ruin
your carefully choreographed grand show.

41:20.070 --> 41:21.400
By the way, Fourth Lady.

41:23.380 --> 41:25.280
My cloak is priceless.

41:26.020 --> 41:27.380
You must keep it well.

41:28.860 --> 41:29.460
After all,

41:30.610 --> 41:32.210
we have plenty of time ahead.

41:37.460 --> 41:39.130
What he wants is not grain.

41:39.410 --> 41:40.850
He has a hidden motive.

41:41.290 --> 41:43.860
Could his target also be the Xie family?
